arried enjoying ourselves while over there in that courtyard."},{"startMs":722001,"endMs":727000,"text":"The foot... ...the headaches, the hair falling out, and those night..."},{"startMs":748001,"endMs":750000,"text":"Oh, God. Not now."},{"startMs":751001,"endMs":754000,"text":"Have a little head from our binge. Do you mind putting the light out?"},{"startMs":756001,"endMs":758000,"text":"George, you were going to go places together."},{"startMs":759001,"endMs":762001,"text":"I'm going to work hard for you and give you all the things you should have."},{"startMs":763000,"endMs":764000,"text":"Make you proud of me."},{"startMs":765000,"endMs":768001,"text":"I have everything I want, and I am proud of you."},{"startMs":769000,"endMs":769001,"text":"Very proud."},{"startMs":771000,"endMs":772000,"text":"You want to pray for you?"},{"startMs":773001,"endMs":776000,"text":"No. I'm never afraid when I'm with you."},{"startMs":778001,"endMs":780000,"text":"Then why should I be?"},{"startMs":783000,"endMs":785000,"text":"By the way, have I told you lately that I adore you?"},{"startMs":786000,"endMs":787001,"text":"Only three times in the last ten minutes."},{"startMs":788000,"endMs":789000,"text":"Well, I left it off."},{"startMs":790000,"endMs":791001,"text":"Well, you stay here glottin' all of you."},{"startMs":793000,"endMs":794001,"text":"It was nice seeing your friends, wasn't it?"},{"startMs":795000,"endMs":795001,"text":"Very nice."},{"startMs":796001,"endMs":798000,"text":"Was his news important?"},{"startMs":800000,"endMs":804000,"text":"[...] been, but..."},{"startMs":804000,"endMs":809000,"text":"But now..."}]}